            </SerializationItem>
            <SerializationItem>
                <IsListValue>false</IsListValue>
                <Name>Annotation</Name>
                <Value xsi:type="xsd:string">Get a transaction item from a specified source (e.g., Orchestrator queues, spreadsheets, databases, mailboxes or web APIs). 

If there are multiple transactions, use the argument in_TransactionNumber as an index to retrieve the correct transaction to be processed. If there are no more transactions left, it is necessary to set out_TransactionItem to Null, thus ending the process.</Value>
